      </div>
      <div id="timerBar">⏰ Time Left: <span id="timerText">03:00</span></div>
      <div id="quizArea">
        <form id="quizForm">
          <div class="question"><b>Q1. What are the 5 steps to build a client website?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="a"> Brief → Plan → Design → Code → Test & Launch</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="b"> Code → Code → Code → Code → Code</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="c"> Design → Launch → Brief</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="d"> Launch → Brief → Plan</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q2. What to ask in Brief?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="a"> What do you sell? Who are customers? What should website DO?</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="b"> Only your name?</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="c"> Only your age?</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="d"> Nothing</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q3. How is cart stored?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="a"> Array - cart.push(product) on Add button</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="b"> Single string</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="c"> Single number</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="d"> No storage</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q4. How to calculate cart total?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="a"> Loop cart, total += item.price for each item</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="b"> cart.length only</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="c"> First item price only</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="d"> Random number</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q5. How to show products with Search + Filter?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="a"> Show only if matchSearch AND matchFilter both true</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="b"> Show all always</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="c"> Show only search</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="d"> Show only filter</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q6. How to open WhatsApp with order?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="a"> window.open("https://wa.me/number?text=" + encodeURIComponent(msg))</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="b"> alert(msg)</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="c"> console.log(msg)</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="d"> document.write(msg)</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q7. Why use encodeURIComponent for WhatsApp message?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="a"> Spaces and symbols in message break URL - It makes them safe</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="b"> To make faster</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="c"> To add color</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="d"> No reason</label></div>
